{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"有片丨碰到氣球就輸！武警裝甲車挑戰直角極限「掟彎」\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-20-15-47-04r8DTWGTf.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】武警官兵開裝甲車訓練，挑戰直角限制路極限轉彎。轉彎路兩側放置氣球，裝甲車行駛時碰到即為不合格！面對裝甲車車身長、空間窄，裝甲車挑戰直角轉彎絕對是極高難度，究竟能否順過「掟彎」？</p><p>資訊及視頻來源：央視軍事</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T08:04:03.234494+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":1,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T06:24:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T21:37:31.976846+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T07:57:36.644875+00:00","content_hash":"d24d461054d5cae046cb2692d33f9fc09255d9874677ffde937fcd6ae8712573","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T08:04:03.234494+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}